### Topic 28 - Spring Boot Introduction
### Start the app first: mvn spring-boot:run
### Then click "Send Request" above each request (VS Code "REST Client" extension).

### 1. Say hello (default name)
GET http://localhost:8080/hello

### 2. Say hello to a specific person
GET http://localhost:8080/hello?name=Asha

### 3. JSON info - a Map turned into JSON automatically
GET http://localhost:8080/info

### 4. Actuator health check (comes "for free" with spring-boot-starter-actuator)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
